{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15456","headline":"闲园即事赠考功王员外 · 李端","name":"闲园即事赠考功王员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南陌晴云稍变霞，东风动柳水纹斜。\n园林带雪潜生草，桃李虽春未有花。\n幸接上宾登郑驿，羞爲长女似黄家。\n今朝一望还成暮，欲别芳菲恋岁华。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15456.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15456","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}